; Slow 1200mV -40C Model Removal: 'sys_clk'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ;
+-------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------+-------------+--------------+------------+------------+
